  "alignment_decisions_added": [
    "Uniform internal capabilities do not bypass Notion or SBE data authorization.",
    "Notion workspace roles and SBE native-space roles are independent and share only subject identity.",
    "Notion workspace SQLite and central SBE SQLite remain separate canonical authorities and schema lineages.",
    "Publication resolves one committed Notion revision/hash/epoch, revalidates source authorization, uses the SBE service layer with operation_id/request hash, and revalidates target SBE authority.",
    "Personal+Part publication creates two independent SBE items and histories in one SBE transaction; later Notion edits never auto-sync them.",
    "Notion revoke blocks live/unpublished source access and new publication but never hides, deactivates, or deletes an already-published SBE item.",
    "One selected Wiki/view per conversation, server-owned CorpusClosure, ten results, four pins, and 32 KiB excerpt limits remain authoritative.",
    "Notion timestamps never enter SBE canonical body/hash/search/dedup/semantic/rerank/excerpt inputs.",
    "All retryable mutations use service-layer transactions, operation IDs/request hashes, and atomic audit/outbox; expensive work stays outside transactions with pre-commit revalidation.",
    "SBE v1-v7 remain historical; v8-v11 require the active owning SBE packet, forward-only checksummed migration, single migrator, and rollout gate.",
    "D0B/SBE-7.2, S0B/SBE protected paths, and O1/Q0/R0/R1 target operations have explicit cross-stream handoff gates.",
    "Automated tests always use sanitized runner-owned roots; production copies and canaries are separate approved operator actions.",
    "Notion matrix performance and operations rows are namespaced ICN-PERF-001 and ICN-OPS-001/002, separate from TEST_OPERATIONS scenario IDs.",
    "Multiprocess and target Windows receipts require process identities, roles, shared DB identity, fault points, p50/p95/p99, SQLite busy, queue/projection lag, and restore timing.",
    "Z0 closes the Notion product only; active shared-goal completion additionally requires current SBE test, traceability, and goal-contract gates."
  ],
